INSERT INTO public.reflections (title, theme, short_reflection, practical_application, question, premium_extended_version, tags, status, publish_date, is_premium_only, sort_order) VALUES

('The Paralysis of Options',
 'decisions',
 'When faced with too many choices, it''s easy to feel overwhelmed and stuck,...''s guidance can bring clarity and peace. Remember, not making a choice is still a choice, and often, God''s grace meets us in the next step we take.',
 'Today, when you feel overwhelmed by options, pause and pray for God''s wisdom. Write down the pros and...''s values of love, kindness, and integrity. Commit to making a decision, trusting God will guide your steps.',
 'What is one difficult decision you''ve been avoiding, and how might trusting God help you take the next step?',
 'Decision paralysis often arises from an abundance of options that scatter our focus and heighten fear of making the wrong choice. Scripture offers us a profound remedy: trusting God wholeheartedly rather than leaning on our limited understanding (Proverbs 3:5-6). This trust doesn''t mean passivity or ignoring practical wisdom—rather,...''s sovereignty in our lives. When overwhelmed, taking small, intentional steps grounded in prayer and reflection can break the cycle of indecision. God''s grace isn''t reserved for perfect choices but meets...''s guidance is present even in uncertainty. Today''s challenge is to lean into that promise, moving forward with trust, not fear.',
