('When There Is No Clear Answer',
 'decisions',
 'Life often places us at crossroads where the right choice isn''t obvious. In these moments of ambiguity, it''s natural to feel unsettled and uncertain....''t clear, faith invites us to step forward with trust, knowing God walks with us through every gray area.',
 'Today, pause for a moment of quiet reflection and invite God into your decision-making process. Write down the options you''re considering and ask God to give...''t yet visible.',
 'How can I learn to embrace uncertainty and trust God more deeply when decisions feel ambiguous?',
 'When faced with difficult decisions that lack a clear or easy answer, it''s normal to wrestle with doubt and fear. The Bible doesn''t promise that every choice will be...''s okay to not have all the answers immediately. Faith is often a journey of small steps, seeking God''s guidance in prayer, wise counsel, and...''s intention and your willingness to trust Him amid uncertainty. Let this truth bring peace and courage today.',
