('The Power of Small Choices',
 'decisions',
 'Sometimes, it''s the small, daily decisions that shape our lives more than the big, dramatic ones. Each choice we make builds habits that guide our paths, much like how little drops of water carve a stone over time. Scripture reminds us in Proverbs 3:5-6 to trust the Lord in all our ways, even in the seemingly insignificant moments. Trusting God in these small decisions invites His wisdom and peace into our everyday lives.',
 'Today, pay attention to one small decision you might usually overlook—whether it''s how you speak to someone, how you manage your time, or how you respond to stress. Choose to do it with intentionality and prayer, inviting God into that moment.',
 'What small choice can I make today that, over time, could bring me closer to the person God is calling me to be?',
 'When faced with difficult decisions, it''s easy to focus only on the...''t mean ignoring the complexity of our decisions but rather surrendering even the smallest ones to His guidance. By embracing the power of these small choices, we build habits rooted in faith, shaping our character and direction over time. Today''s challenge is to recognize that each...''s will and experience His grace in the ordinary.',
