('Choosing Integrity Over Ease',
 'decisions',
 'Life often presents us with choices that test our character. Choosing integrity over the easy shortcut isn''t always the most comfortable path, but it shapes who we are. Proverbs reminds us that the way of the righteous is like the morning sun, shining ever brighter. When we choose honesty and faithfulness, even in difficult decisions, we honor God and grow stronger in our walk.',
