 'When faced with a tough decision, how can I remind myself that integrity matters more than immediate comfort or gain?',
 'Difficult decisions often pull us toward the path of least resistance, tempting us to compromise our values for quicker results or less discomfort. However, choosing integrity is a profound act of faith and courage. Proverbs 10:9 says, ''Whoever walks in integrity walks securely, but whoever takes crooked paths will be found out.''This scriptural wisdom assures us that although...''t about perfection but about a daily commitment to do what is right, even when it is difficult. Letting God''s strength guide your decisions empowers you...''s plan.',
